            </rdf:Seq>
         </dc:creator>
         <dc:description>
            <rdf:Alt>
               <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">The NCP51820 highâˆ’speed, gate driver is designed to meet the&#xD;&#xA;stringent requirements of driving enhancement mode (eâˆ’mode), high&#xD;&#xA;electron mobility transistor (HEMT) and gate injection transistor&#xD;&#xA;(GIT), gallium nitrade (GaN) power switches in offâˆ’line, halfâˆ’bridge&#xD;&#xA;power topologies.</rdf:li>
            </rdf:Alt>
         </dc:description>
         <pdf:Producer>Acrobat Distiller 22.0 (Windows)</pdf:Producer>
